    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fb29c832773c4854dcba34c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱钻奇宝似乎是从我的语气明白了我是在开玩笑，\n她微微一笑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd5e42079c9e64c0615d9e8976306acc1672bbaf7bf8b8a9f7e095e6ef8bd731",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cb27f6124f081017d6a986c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──我不追求要有相同的热情。\n但如果她的心愿是想跑步，想获胜的话──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d075bba8beb4fcfc76fbed18ce6ed27700791e3de86bfd9b4295096d4953020a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c13d3390d1ff2ae8b68dd280",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还是要跑回学园？",
      "source_fingerprint": "88672405e1071a10e2e693be010c02db4b2c5a6d1ccbffcf841398f4f5dafcda",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15a12062f5c4f453164742da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或是想为了我的期待而努力的话，\n我想帮助她，让她能够理所当然地做到这些事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c0297ee7fa14a9e2f8e1d62002f15f2f763a679405478683642184aba623767",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106007.json",
      "json_path": [
